      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the curious girdle of his ephod, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon it, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the same, according to the work thereof; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gold, blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine twined linen; as the LORD commanded Moses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they wrought onyx stones inclosed in ouches of gold, graven as signets are graven, with the names of the children of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
