        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It was foursquare; they made the breast-plate double: a span ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the length of it, and a span the breadth of it, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "being",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " doubled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they set in it four rows of stones: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the first",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " row ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sardius, a topaz, and a carbuncle: this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the first row.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the second row, an emerald, a sapphire, and a diamond.",
