    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the fourth row, a beryl, an onyx, and a jasper: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " inclosed in ouches of gold in their inclosings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the stones ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to the names of the children of Israel, twelve, according to their names, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the engravings of a signet, every one with his name, according to the twelve tribes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
