      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they bound the breast-plate by its rings to the rings of the ephod with a lace of blue, that it might be above the curious girdle of the ephod, and that the breast-plate might not be loosed from the ephod; as the LORD commanded Moses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.39.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.39.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the robe of the ephod ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " woven work, all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blue.",
          "kind": "text"
